      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/engadine_michigan"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "After logging declined, doctor William McNamara founded the Hiawatha Sportsman’s Club in 1927, preserving land for fishing and hunting.",
